Z||000004||Elenor84||12-11-2001||01:48 AM||||Jeff, u did switch all your wiring in your interior to right?  If not your going to have to.  U need to rip your dash apart and put all v6 wiring up front to.  Thats just for the guages.  Now for your problem at hand...did u install the second clump of wires coming from the ecm(fuse box by the battery)?  <P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
